<%- include('../partials/head', { page }) %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>
<main class="main-content article-main" id="main-content"><div class="article-shell quiz-shell">
  <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Learning lab</span></div>
  <header class="page-masthead quiz-masthead reveal"><div class="masthead-copy"><span class="article-eyebrow"><span class="kicker-line"></span> LEARNING LAB / 10 QUESTIONS</span><h1>What have you<br><em>noticed so far?</em></h1><p class="article-deck">Test your understanding of mountain formation, vertical ecology, water, wildlife and care for the landscape. Learn something with every answer.</p><div class="quiz-badges"><span>10 questions</span><span>Instant feedback</span><span>No timer</span></div></div><div class="masthead-art"><img src="<%= imageSrc('quiz.svg') %>" data-image-fallback="/img/quiz.svg" alt="Illustrated mountain peaks under open sky"><span>OBSERVE / CONNECT / REMEMBER</span></div></header>
  <section class="quiz-panel reveal" data-quiz><div class="quiz-progress-head"><span id="quiz-progress-label">QUESTION 01 / <%= quizQuestions.length %></span><span id="quiz-score-label">0 correct so far</span></div><div class="quiz-progress"><span id="quiz-progress-bar"></span></div><div id="quiz-question-area"><% quizQuestions.forEach((question,index)=> { %><section class="quiz-question" data-question="<%= index %>" data-correct="<%= question.correct %>" data-explain="<%= question.explain %>" <%= index===0?'':'hidden' %>><span class="small-label">FIELD KNOWLEDGE / <%= String(index+1).padStart(2,'0') %></span><h2><%= question.q %></h2><div class="quiz-options"><% question.options.forEach((option,optIndex)=> { %><button class="quiz-option" type="button" data-option="<%= optIndex %>"><span class="option-letter"><%= String.fromCharCode(65+optIndex) %></span><span><%= option %></span><span class="option-check">↗</span></button><% }); %></div><div class="quiz-explanation" hidden></div></section><% }); %></div><div class="quiz-controls"><button id="quiz-next" class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled>Next question <span>→</span></button><button id="quiz-restart" class="text-link" type="button" hidden>Start again ↺</button></div><div id="quiz-results" class="quiz-results" hidden></div></section>
  <section class="quiz-bottom-note"><div class="note-symbol">✳</div><div><h2>Learning is a trail, not a finish line.</h2><p>Use any missed question as a lead. The atlas articles and reference library offer a deeper route into each concept.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/references">Go deeper <span>→</span></a></section>
</div><%- include('../partials/footer') %></main>
<%- include('../partials/layout-end') %>
